This folder contains the Internet Mail Consortium's MIME test suite.

These files were provided free of charge online by the IMC.  They did not
apparently explicitly specify a license, so the license is implied.  This
file is just to document where these test suite items came from.

Their notes: The mimetest suite originated with Patrik Fältström. Patrik
handed over control of the suite to IMC but still helps with the
maintenance.

The Internet Mail Consortium no longer exists.

Originally retrieved from:  http://www.imc.org/mimetest/MimeBack.tgz

"mimeback.pl" is the only file not included here from MimeBack.tgz.
